  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Earmarked Contribution to the World Health Organization&apos;s COVID19 Strategic Preparedness and Response Plan 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is given towards the activities of WHO&apos;s Strategic Preparedness and Response Plan (SPRP) and it&apos;s ODA eligible activities. SPRP outlines the public health measures that the international community stands ready to provide to support all countries to prepare for and respond to COVID-19. Denmark&apos;s contribution will be used primarily for countries listed under Levels 1-3 of WHO&#x2019;s SPRP Country Preparedness and Response Status for COVID-19 (version 9 April 2020), with the exemption of Cook Island.</narrative>
  </description>
